This use case uses Dex (exmergo/dex), DuckDB, dbt Core/dbt-duckdb,
and MetricFlow. Dependency licenses remain with their respective authors.
MetricFlow is pinned to its Apache-2.0 0.211 release family.

The collection workflow reuses jgehrcke/github-repo-stats at commit
306db38ad131cab2aa5f2cd3062bf6f8aa78c1aa (Apache-2.0).
The example imports public statistics published by exmergo/dex on its
github-repo-stats branch; raw source commits are recorded for attribution.
Synthetic test data are generated by this repository and are not real traffic.
